#. Tag: title
#: details.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Object Details Window</title>"
msgstr "<title>Prozor sa detaljima objekta</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: details.docbook:3
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Alati"

#. Tag: secondary
#: details.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "<secondary>Object Details Window</secondary>"
msgstr "<secondary>Prozor sa detaljima objekata</secondary>"

#. Tag: primary
#: details.docbook:5 details.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Objects in the Sky"
msgstr "Objekti na nebu"

#. Tag: secondary
#: details.docbook:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "Details"
msgstr "Detalji"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Object Details Window"
msgstr "Prozor sa detaljima objekata"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Object Details Window</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Prozor sa detaljima objekata</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: details.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Object Details Window presents advanced data available about a specific "
"object in the sky. To access this tool, <mousebutton>right</mousebutton>-"
"click on any object, and select the <guimenuitem>Details...</guimenuitem> "
"item from the popup menu."
msgstr ""
"Prozor sa detaljima objekata predstavlja napredne podatke koji su dostupni o "
"određenom objektu u nebu.Da bi pristupili ovom alatu, <mousebutton>desni</"
"mousebutton>klik na objekat,i selektirati <guimenuitem>Detalje...</"
"guimenuitem>stavku iz popup menia."

#. Tag: para
#: details.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The window is divided into a number of Tabs. In the <guilabel>General</"
"guilabel> Tab, we present basic data about the current object. This includes "
"names and catalog designations, object type, and <link linkend=\"ai-magnitude"
"\">magnitude</link> (brightness). On the <guilabel>Position</guilabel> tab "
"are the object's Equatorial and Horizontal coordinates, as well as its rise, "
"set and transit times."
msgstr ""
"TOvaj prozor je podijeljen u broj tabova. U <guilabel>General</guilabel> "
"Tabu, se nalaze osnovni podaci o trenutnom objektu. To ulkjucuje ime ime i "
"katalog ozbje, tip objekta, i<link linkend=\"ai-magnitude\">velicinu</link> "
"(svjetlinu). Na<guilabel>Poziciji</guilabel>Tabu su  Ekvatorijalna i "
"horizontalna koordinata, kao i usponod objekta."

#. Tag: secondary
#: details.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "Internet Links"
msgstr "Internet Linkovi"

#. Tag: tertiary
#: details.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customizing"
msgstr "Prilagodi"

#. Tag: para
#: details.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Links</guilabel> tab, you can manage the internet links "
"associated with this object. The Image and Information links associated with "
"the object are listed. These are the links that appear in the popup menu "
"when the object is <mousebutton>right</mousebutton>-clicked. You can add "
"custom links to the object with the <guibutton>Add Link...</guibutton> "
"button. This will open a window in which you fill in the &URL; and link text "
"for the new link (you can also test the &URL; in the web browser from this "
"window). Keep in mind that the custom link can easily point to a file on "
"your local disk, so you can use this feature to index your personal "
"astronomical images or observing logs."
msgstr ""
"U kartici <guilabel> Linkovi </guilabel>, možete upravljati internet veze "
"povezane s ovim predmetom. Navedene sliku i informatika linkovi povezane s "
"predmetom. To su linkovi koji se pojavljuju u popup meniju kad je objekt "
"<mousebutton> desno </mousebutton> -kliknut. Možete dodati prilagođene "
"linkove na objekt s <guibutton> Dodaj ... </guibutton> gumbom. To će "
"otvoriti prozor u kojem ćete ispuniti i URL; i povezati tekst za novu vezu "
"(također možete testirati i URL, na web-preglednika s ovom prozoru). Imajte "
"na umu koje prilagođene linkove možemo lako ukazati na datoteci na vašem "
"lokalnom disku, tako da možete koristiti ovu mogućnosti da indeksirate vaše "
"osobne astronomske fotografije ili promatranje dnevnika."

#. Tag: para
#: details.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also modify or remove any link using the <guibutton>Edit Link...</"
"guibutton> and <guibutton>Remove Link...</guibutton> buttons."
msgstr ""
"Također možete promijeniti ili ukloniti bilo kakvu povezanost pomoću "
"<guibutton> Uredi Link ... </guibutton> i <guibutton> ukloniti link... </"
"guibutton> tipke."

#. Tag: para
#: details.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> Tab (not available for all objects) allows "
"you to query professional astronomical databases on the internet for "
"information regarding the current object. To use these databases, double "
"click on the desired database in the list to see the results of your query "
"in a web browser window. The query is made using the primary name of the "
"object you clicked on to open the Details Dialog. The following databases "
"are available for querying:"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel> Napredno </guilabel> Tab (nije dostupno za sve predmete) "
"omogućuje vam da posaljet upit u profesionalne astronomske baze podataka na "
"internetu za informacije o trenutnom objekta. Za korištenje ove baze "
"podataka, dvaput kliknite na željenu bazu podataka na popisu kako biste "
"vidjeli rezultate vašeg upita u prozoru web preglednika.Upita je napravljen "
"pomoću primarnog ime objekta na kojeg ste kliknuli na otvaranje pojedinosti "
"dijalog. Sljedeće baze su dostupne za upite:"

#. Tag: para
#: details.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"High Energy Astrophysical Archive (HEASARC). Here you can retrieve data "
"about the current object from a number of <quote>High-energy</quote> "
"observatories, which covers the Ultraviolet, X-ray and Gamma Ray portions of "
"the electromagnetic spectrum."
msgstr ""
"High Energy Astrophysical Archive (HEASARC). Ovdje možete preuzeti podatke o "
"trenutnom objekta iz broja <quote> visoke energije </quote> zapazanju, koji "
"pokriva ultraljubičasto, X-zraka i gama zraka dijelove elektromagnetskog "
"spektra."

#. Tag: para
#: details.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Multimission Archive at Space Telescope (MAST). The Space Telescope Science "
"Institute provides access to the entire collection of images and spectra "
"taken with the Hubble Space Telescope, as well as several other space-based "
"observatories."
msgstr ""
"Multimission Archive at Space Telescope (MAST). The Space Telescope Science "
"Institut  nudi pristup cijelom zbirkom slika i spektara snimljenih sa "
"svemirskog teleskopa Hubble, kao i nekoliko drugih svemirskih opservatorija.."

#. Tag: para
#: details.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"NASA Astrophysical Data System (ADS). This incredible bibliographic database "
"encompass the entire body of literature published in international peer-"
"review Journals about astronomy and astrophysics. The database is divided "
"into four general subject areas (Astronomy and Astrophysics, Astrophysics "
"Preprints, Instrumentation, and Physics and Geophysics). Each of these has "
"three sub-nodes that query the database in different ways. <quote>Keyword "
"search</quote> will return articles which listed the object's name as a "
"keyword. <quote>Title word search</quote> will return articles which "
"included the object name in their Title, and the <quote>Title &amp; Keyword "
"search</quote> uses both options together."
msgstr ""
"NASA Astrophysical Data System (ADS).  Ova nevjerojatna bibliografska baza "
"obuhvaća cijelo tijelo književnosti objavljen u međunarodna recenzija "
"časopisa o astronomiji i astrofizici.Baza jest podijeljena u četiri općim "
"područjima (astronomiju i astrofiziku, astrofiziku , instrumentaciju i "
"fiziku i geofiziku). Svaki od njih ima tri pod-čvorova koje upita bazi "
"podataka na različite načine. <quote> Traženje po ključnoj riječi </quote> "
"će se vratiti članke koje navedene ime objekta kao ključnu riječ. <quote> "
"Naslov riječi za pretraživanje </quote> će se vratiti članke koji su "
"uključivali ime objekt u svojoj glavi, i <quote> Naslov &amp; Ključna Riječ "
"</quote> koristi obje opcije zajedno."

#. Tag: para
#: details.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"NASA/IPAC Extragalactic Database (NED). NED provides encapsulated data and "
"bibliographic links about extragalactic objects. You should only use NED if "
"your target is extragalactic; &ie; if it is itself a galaxy."
msgstr ""
"NASA / IPAC Extragalactic Database (NED). NED daje daje upakovane podatke i "
"bibliografske podatkeo extragalacticom objektu. Trebali biste koristiti samo "
"Ned ako je vaš cilj je Extragalactic; &ie; ako je to i sam galaksija."

#. Tag: para
#: details.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set of Identifications, Measurements, and Bibliography for Astronomical Data "
"(SIMBAD). SIMBAD is similar to NED, except it provides data about all kinds "
"of objects, not just galaxies."
msgstr ""
"Postavi identifikacije, mjerenja i bibliografije za astronomskih podataka "
"(SIMBAD). SIMBAD je sličan NED, osim što daje podatke o svim vrstama "
"objekata, ne samo galaksija."

#. Tag: para
#: details.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"SkyView provides images from All-Sky surveys that have been performed in "
"dozens of different parts of the spectrum, from Gamma Rays to the Radio. The "
"&kstars; interface will retrieve an image from any of these surveys, "
"centered on the selected object."
msgstr ""
"SkyView daje slike iz All-Sky istraživanja koje su izvršene u desecima "
"različitih dijelova spektra, od gama zrake radio.&kstars; Interfejs će "
"dohvatiti sliku iz bilo koje od tih istraživanja, usmjeren na odabrani "
"objekt."

#. Tag: para
#: details.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Finally, in the <guilabel>Log</guilabel> Tab, you can type in some text that "
"will remain associated with this object's Details window. You could use this "
"to attach personal observing notes, for example."
msgstr ""
"Konačno, u <guilabel> Logu </guilabel> tabu, možete upisati tekst koje će "
"ostati povezan s tim objektovim Prozorom sa detaljima. Možete koristiti ovaj "
"dodatak za osobne posmatracke bilješke, npr."
